  render_p(sec_bc, "Four targets tested at DEEP (Z/970200): D*K product (x%8)*(x%9), E*b product (x%25)*(x%49), D+K sum (x%8)+(x%9), D*K*E triple (x%8)*(x%9)*(x%25). All 4 cross from wall to 970200/970200 with bloom. The additive target achieves ZERO per-channel matches -- even harder than the multiplicative wall. Partial CRT: for 2-channel functions, only 19 params needed (vs 107 full).");
